@startuml 05-start-run-sequence
!include theme.puml
title start_run：最小接受、上下文组装、Agent Loop 与事件发布顺序

autonumber
participant "业务编排" as ORCH LC_ORCHESTRATION
participant "AgentGateway" as GW LC_KERNEL
participant "请求守卫 / 技术路由" as GUARD LC_KERNEL
participant "TimePort" as TIME_PORT LC_KERNEL
participant "SystemTimeAdapter" as TIME_ADAPTER LC_INFRASTRUCTURE
participant "最小 Run Supervisor" as SUPERVISOR LC_KERNEL
participant "Context Engine" as CONTEXT LC_KERNEL
participant "Tool Runtime" as TOOL LC_KERNEL
participant "Agent Loop Engine" as LOOP LC_KERNEL
participant "AgentAdapter" as ADAPTER_PORT LC_KERNEL
participant "PiAgentAdapter" as PI_ADAPTER LC_ADAPTER
database "最小 Run / Event Store" as DB
participant "事件订阅者" as SUBSCRIBER LC_ORCHESTRATION

ORCH -> GW : AgentGateway.start_run\n(RequestContext, ContextSpec, ToolPolicyRef, DelegationPolicy)
GW -> GUARD : 校验 tenant / UTC deadline / IANA TimeContext\n幂等 / 预算 / 能力
GUARD -> TIME_PORT : now / parseIsoUtc / 校验时区
TIME_PORT -> TIME_ADAPTER : TimePort
TIME_ADAPTER --> GUARD : UTC TimePoint / 支持状态
GUARD -> DB : 写 CommandReceipt + AgentRun(ACCEPTED)\n+ RunAccepted(sequence=1)
DB --> GUARD : commit(run_id)
GUARD --> GW : 已接受快照
GW --> ORCH : run_id / status=ACCEPTED

... 接受响应与异步智能执行解耦 ...
SUPERVISOR -> CONTEXT : assemble(ContextSpec, ContextPolicy)
CONTEXT --> SUPERVISOR : ContextFrame + ReductionTrace
SUPERVISOR -> TOOL : resolveTools(ToolPolicyRef)
TOOL --> SUPERVISOR : 有界 ToolDescriptor 集
SUPERVISOR -> LOOP : start(ContextFrame, ToolSet, DelegationPolicy)
SUPERVISOR -> TIME_PORT : 计算 min(RunBudget, Operation deadline)\n生成 UTC 事件时间

loop 模型—工具/委派—继续，受轮次、Token、时间与子 Run 预算约束
  LOOP -> ADAPTER_PORT : AgentAdapter.executeTurn\n(规范化 ContextFrame + ToolDescriptor)
  ADAPTER_PORT -> PI_ADAPTER : Pi 私有消息 / Provider 调用
  PI_ADAPTER --> ADAPTER_PORT : RuntimeEventCandidate
  ADAPTER_PORT --> LOOP : OutputDelta / ToolRequested / TurnCompleted
  LOOP -> CONTEXT : 追加结果并构造下一轮 ContextFrame
  CONTEXT --> LOOP : 新快照 / 裁剪原因
end

loop 每个对外规范化 AgentEvent
  LOOP -> DB : append_event(run_id, expected_sequence)
  DB --> LOOP : commit(sequence=n)
  LOOP -->> SUBSCRIBER : AgentEvent（提交后发布）
end

note over GW,DB
  首版只要求最小接受记录、租户隔离、严格序号和可补拉事件；
  不以复杂 Attempt / fence / Checkpoint 作为 Agent Loop 启动前置条件。
  约束：UP-DAT-001、UP-RES-001、UP-CTX-002、UP-INF-002
end note
@enduml
